      "description": "The single primary action: off-white on graphite, Copied state on green.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-copy\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"/></svg><span>Copy</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-copy{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem;min-width:5.4rem;font:500 .82rem/1 \"Mona Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;color:#0a0b0d;background:#eceef1;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:.55rem .8rem;cursor:pointer}.ds-copy svg{width:1em;height:1em;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-copy:hover{background:#fff}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3987e5;outline-offset:3px}.ds-copy.done{background:#3fb950}"
    },
